{
  "cols": 120,
  "rows": 40,
  "wtProfile": "Invite de commandes",
  "colorScheme": "Campbell",
  "model": "haiku",
  "theme": "dark",
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "allow": [
    "Read",
    "Edit",
    "Write",
    "Bash",
    "Glob",
    "Grep",
    "Agent",
    "Task"
  ],
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "01-accueil",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "waitText",
          "pattern": "shift.tab to cycle",
          "timeoutMs": 45000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 2500
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "01",
          "name": "accueil"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02-markdown",
      "prompt": "Sans utiliser d'outil, reponds en markdown : un titre ##, un sous-titre ###, une liste a puces de 3 elements avec un mot en **gras**, un mot en *italique* et du `code en ligne`, une liste numerotee de 2 elements, puis un bloc de code python de 8 lignes.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "waitStop",
          "count": 1,
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "02",
          "name": "markdown-code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03-outils",
      "files": [
        "notes.txt"
      ],
      "prompt": "Lis notes.txt avec l'outil Read, puis lance la commande Bash `seq 1 5 | tee nombres.txt`. Ne commente pas, reponds juste ok.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "waitStop",
          "count": 1,
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "03",
          "name": "outils-tronque"
        },
        {
          "do": "keys",
          "send": "^o"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 2000
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "03b",
          "name": "outils-detail-ctrl-o"
        },
        {
          "do": "keys",
          "send": "^o"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04-edit",
      "files": [
        "config.py"
      ],
      "prompt": "Dans config.py, avec un seul appel de l'outil Edit, remplace les deux lignes TIMEOUT = 30 et RETRIES = 3 par les trois lignes TIMEOUT = 60, RETRIES = 5 et BACKOFF = 1.5. Puis reponds juste ok.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "waitStop",
          "count": 1,
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "04",
          "name": "edit-diff"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05-agents",
      "prompt": "Lance en parallele, dans un seul message, deux sous-agents avec l'outil Agent : agent-bleu et agent-rouge. Chacun doit executer la commande Bash `ping -n 30 127.0.0.1` puis repondre fini. Quand les deux ont fini, resume en une ligne.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "waitText",
          "pattern": "background agents? launched|agents? launched",
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 5000
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "05",
          "name": "agents-en-cours"
        },
        {
          "do": "waitStop",
          "count": 2,
          "timeoutMs": 300000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 2000
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "06",
          "name": "agents-termines"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07-question",
      "prompt": "Utilise l'outil AskUserQuestion pour me demander quel langage je prefere, avec 3 options : Rust, TypeScript, Python.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "waitText",
          "pattern": "Enter to|Esc to cancel|to navigate",
          "timeoutMs": 90000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "07",
          "name": "question"
        },
        {
          "do": "keys",
          "send": "{ESC}"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 1500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "08-interruption",
      "prompt": "Lance la commande Bash `ping -n 90 127.0.0.1`, puis dis termine.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "waitText",
          "pattern": "\\$ ping|shell command",
          "timeoutMs": 90000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 4000
        },
        {
          "do": "keys",
          "send": "{ESC}"
        },
        {
          "do": "waitText",
          "pattern": "Interrupted",
          "timeoutMs": 20000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "08",
          "name": "interruption"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "09-erreurs",
      "prompt": "Fais ces trois actions l'une apres l'autre, sans rien corriger ni relire : 1) avec l'outil Edit, dans config.py, remplace la ligne INEXISTANT = 0 par X = 1 ; 2) lance en Bash `mkdir dossier-absent/sous-dossier` ; 3) lance en Bash `exit 3`. Puis reponds juste fait.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "waitStop",
          "count": 1,
          "timeoutMs": 120000
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "do": "capture",
          "id": "09",
          "name": "erreurs"
        },
        {
          "do": "keys",
          "send": "^o"
